  {
    "id": "4b49031c-108e-59d1-82ae-12457789d855",
    "pack": "battlecry",
    "kind": "ritual",
    "slug": "ritual:oil-slicked-walls",
    "name": "Oil-Slicked Walls",
    "level": 2,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "battlecry",
        "page": 94,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Rituals.aspx?ID=211"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The outer walls are a city's first defense against invaders, and you want to make certain no attackers can climb over them. Upon successful completion of this ritual, the surfaces of a settlement's walls within the area are covered with a thin, slippery sheen that can't be washed away."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The oil covering the walls also coats any climber's hands. The DC for Athletics checks to Climb the affected walls increases by 10, and a creature who fails a check to climb also drops anything they are carrying."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The DC for Athletics checks to Climb the affected walls increases by 5."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The ritual has no effect."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Phantom oil constantly pools around your feet during times of stress. For 1 week, the first time each encounter that a primary or secondary caster takes an action to move, they must attempt a Reflex save or Acrobatics check to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "6fb6b45a-8b16-55e4-ba53-e23a62359b56"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " against the ritual's casting DC or fall "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "73c08daf-ef8e-5d9c-a2ac-dcdbfdafd759"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". A caster can Step or "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fe112db5-30e6-5a96-94a1-2356a4820452"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " without having to attempt a check or save."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
